OL,3,Vupppppp5CTuesday
OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith a surge in criminals using
OL,7,     Ffake car number plates to commit
OL,8,     Fcrimes, Traffic Cops are under
OL,9,     Fpressure to locate these cloned
OL,10,     Fcars and catch criminals trying to
OL,11,     Ffly under the radar.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FOfficers investigate reports of
OL,14,     Fsomeone brandishing a 12-inch
OL,15,     Fblade on a residential estate, and
OL,16,     Fhunt down a driver who's caused a
OL,17,     Fcrash driving the wrong way on a
OL,18,     Fdual carriageway.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/9
