OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FInterceptors join with the
OL,7,     FNational Police Air Service to
OL,8,     Fstop two suspects in a car
OL,9,     Fbelieved to be on cloned plates -
OL,10,     Fbut that doesn't stop the driver
OL,11,     Ftaking the pursuit into fields.
OL,12,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FAfter speeding at over 100mph and
OL,14,     Fdriving on the wrong side of the
OL,15,     Froad, the driver of a two-tonne
OL,16,     Fpickup rams an interceptor's car
OL,17,     Fbefore the rest of the team pitch
OL,18,     Fin to help out.
